1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:06,395
I see you sitting at the keys,
A single tear is all I see.

2
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:12,435
Your shaking hands begin to fall,
You walk down from the organ hall.

3
00:00:12,506 --> 00:00:18,640
My Lioness is wide awake!
This is a line no one can break!

4
00:00:18,709 --> 00:00:25,180
I will not leave you in the cold,
You are the one I’ll always hold!

5
00:00:27,745 --> 00:00:33,647
I leave the choir, I run the stairs,
I do not care about their prayers.

6
00:00:33,858 --> 00:00:39,796
Out through the doors into the night,
I run to make your darkness bright.

7
00:00:39,928 --> 00:00:46,070
My Lioness is wide awake!
This is a line no one can break!

8
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:52,436
I will not leave you in the cold,
You are the one I’ll always hold!

9
00:00:53,473 --> 00:00:59,602
I wrap my arms around your chest,
To give your bleeding spirit rest.

10
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:05,791
Your helmet clatters on the stone,
You will not face this night alone.

11
00:01:05,863 --> 00:01:11,663
My Lioness is wide awake!
This is a line no one can break!

12
00:01:11,857 --> 00:01:18,141
I will not leave you in the cold,
You are the one I’ll always hold!

13
00:01:33,161 --> 00:01:39,023
Beneath the shadow of the tower,
We cry away this darkest hour.

14
00:01:39,177 --> 00:01:45,337
I draw a line upon the ground:
Nobody takes what I have found!

15
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:52,849
My Lioness is wide awake!
This is a line no one can break!

16
00:01:52,882 --> 00:01:58,962
I will not leave you in the cold,
You are the one I’ll always hold!

17
00:01:58,972 --> 00:02:04,955
I will not let you break apart,
I hold your heavy, bleeding heart.

18
00:02:04,999 --> 00:02:11,176
"I know the pieces fit," you cry,
And I will love you till I die.

